{"seq":3,"slug":"content-translation","title":"内容翻译篇","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-management-systems","title":"翻译管理系统","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/translation-management-systems","wordCount":1503,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-content-localization","title":"动态内容本地化","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/dynamic-content-localization","wordCount":1320,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"pluralization-gender-grammar","title":"复数化与语法适配","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/pluralization-gender-grammar","wordCount":1538,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 内容翻译篇\n\n内容翻译篇处理后端系统如何管理、分发和渲染多语言文本。翻译不仅是字符串替换——它涉及工作流编排（TMS 与 CI/CD 集成）、运行时动态内容的本地化策略、以及不同语言在语法层面的结构差异（复数、性别、格变化）。三篇文档从系统层面给出翻译管道的设计模式，覆盖静态资源、用户生成内容和语法适配三个维度。\n"}